#etcsl: line-id=9A

@endvariants
10. {d}utu šul {d}utu he₂-me-da-an-zu
#lem: Utu[1]DN; šul[youth]; Utu[1]DN; zu[know]
#tr.en: should know about it from us. A decision that concerns the mountains is @wDN{Utu's} business. 
#etcsl: line-id=10

11. kur-ra dim₂-ma-bi {d}utu-kam
#lem: kur[mountain(s)]; dimma[thought]; Utu[1]DN
#tr.en: A decision that concerns the @wGN{Mountains of Cedar-felling} is the business of youthful @wDN{Utu}. @wDN{Utu} should know about it from us.”} 
#etcsl: line-id=11

12. kur-{ŋiš}erin-kud dim₂-ma-bi šul {d}utu-kam {d}utu he₂-me-da-an-zu
#lem: Kurerinkud[1]GN; dimma[thought]; šul[youth]; Utu[1]DN; Utu[1]DN; zu[know]
#etcsl: line-id=12

