#lem: Kurerinkud[1]GN; kur[enter]; atah[helper]; me[be]
#tr.en: I am going to set off into the @wGN{Mountains of Cedar-felling}! May you be my helper!”} 
#etcsl: line-id=18

19. {d}utu an-na-ta inim mu-ni-ib-gi₄-gi₄
#lem: Utu[1]DN; an[sky]; inim[word]; gi[turn]
#tr.en: From heaven @wDN{Utu} replied to him: @q[Utu,Gilgamec]{“Young man, 
#etcsl: line-id=19

20. ŋuruš dumu-gir₁₅ ni₂-zu-a he₂-me-en kur-ra a-na-bi-me-en
#lem: ŋuruš[young adult male]; dumugir[citizen]; ni[self]; me[be]; kur[mountain(s)]; ana[what?]
#tr.en: you are noble already in your own right -- but what would you want with the mountains?”} 
#etcsl: line-id=20

21. {d}utu inim ga-ra-ab-dug₄ inim-ŋu₁₀-uš ŋeštug₂-zu
#lem: Utu[1]DN; inim[word]; dug[speak]; inim[word]; ŋeštug[ear]
#tr.en: @q[Gilgamec,Utu]{“@wDN{Utu}, I have something to say to you -- a word in your ear! 
#etcsl: line-id=21

22. silim ga-ra-ab-dug₄ ŋizzal he₂-em-ši-ak
#lem: silim[healthy]; dug[speak]; ŋizzal[hearing]; ak[do]
#tr.en: I greet you -- please pay attention! In my city people are dying, 
#etcsl: line-id=22

23. iri{ki}-ŋa₂ lu₂ ba-uš₂ šag₄ ba-sag₃
#lem: iri[city]; lu[person]; uš[die]; šag[heart]; sag[strike]
#tr.en: and hearts are full of distress. People are lost -- that fills me with @vart[t1815.v6,t1815.v6]{@varn{1 ms. adds:} wretched } dismay. 
#etcsl: line-id=23

24. lu₂ u₂-gu ba-an-de₂ (1:šag₄-ŋu₁₀:1) ba-an-gig
#lem: lu[person]; ugu[cvne]; de[pour]; šag[heart]; gig[sick]
#tr.en: I craned my neck over the city wall: corpses in the water make the river almost overflow. 
#etcsl: line-id=24

:24v.1.1: ($2 mss. have instead:$) šag₄ hul
