25. bad₃-da gu₂-ŋa₂ im-ma-an-la₂
#lem: bad[wall]; gu[neck]; la[hang]
#tr.en: That is what I see. 
#etcsl: line-id=25

26. ad₆ a-a ib₂-dirig-ge igi im-ma-an-sig₁₀
#lem: adda[corpse]; a[water]; dirig[make more than]; igi[eye]; sig[put into]
